        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "One of the best dining experiences I’ve had in Miami.\n\nThe fish was absolutely spectacular — perfectly cooked, beautifully presented, and incredibly fresh. Truly some of the best fish I’ve had anywhere. The branzino was a standout — simple, clean, and executed flawlessly.\n\nThe ambiance is easily among the best in Miami. The garden setting, warm lighting, and elegant yet lively atmosphere make it feel both upscale and comfortable. It’s a beautiful room with great energy.\n\nService was friendly, attentive, and polished from start to finish. The team was also very accommodating with dietary needs — they handled nut-free options seamlessly, which was greatly appreciated.\n\nThe bread was amazing — fresh, warm, and hard to stop eating.\n\nThe wine selection was excellent and paired perfectly with the meal.\n\nIf you’re looking for exceptional seafood in a stunning setting with top-tier service, Cecconi’s delivers on every level. I’ll definitely be back."
