        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Our first time at Chef Adrianne’s and wow… we were blown away!\nFrom start to finish, every single dish we ordered was absolutely exquisite. We started with the salmon crispy rice, the pork belly, and the\npull-a-part bread; each one was packed with flavor and perfectly prepared. For the main course, the New Zealand lamb rack, was cooked to absolute perfection.\nA special thank you goes out to our wonderful waiter, Alonso. His service was outstanding, and he made our evening truly memorable. Following his excellent recommendation, we tried the \"white chocolate tres leches croissant bread pudding\" for dessert, and it was out of this world! You have to try it!\nWe had an amazing time and will definitely be returning very soon. Highly recommended!"
