        "text": "I had an amazing Birthday dinner at Marion. I was in Miami for F1 weekend and they did a good job providing a fun ambience, even dressing in theme. There were dance performances & a DJ playing for the restaurant. I sat inside at a booth table with a group. The food was tasty and there were a lot of options to choose from. I really enjoyed the sushi roasting at the table! I liked the interior style & it felt elevated, modern, art deco inspired with a tropical flair. @losnenesnightlife were helpful in creating a memorable night for my trip, I’m very grateful!"
