        "text": "My dining experience at Komodo was exceptional from start to finish. The food, cocktails, and service were all outstanding.\n\nA special shoutout to Douglas, our server, who was attentive, knowledgeable, and made sure our experience was seamless throughout the evening.\n\nThe Hamachi Crudo was incredibly fresh and flavorful, and the salmon tacos were easily one of the highlights of the meal. The chicken fried rice was perfectly prepared and packed with flavor—comfort food elevated to another level. To top it all off, the lychee martinis were absolutely delicious and dangerously easy to keep ordering!\n\nThe atmosphere was vibrant, upscale, and perfect for a night out in Miami. Between the amazing food, great cocktails, and Douglas’s exceptional service, this was a five-star experience. I can’t wait to come back. Highly recommend!"
