      "Tuesday: 5:00 – 10:00 PM",
      "Wednesday: 5:00 – 10:00 PM",
      "Thursday: 5:00 – 10:00 PM",
      "Friday: 5:00 – 11:00 PM",
      "Saturday: 12:00 – 5:00 PM, 6:00 – 11:00 PM",
      "Sunday: 11:00 AM – 3:00 PM, 6:00 – 10:00 PM"
