        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "It’s rare that I give 5 stars on all 3 categories. There are many new restaurants in Miami to choose from nowadays. Many of them leave a lot to be desired. Today was my second time at Catch and it did not disappoint. From the wine selection to every single course, everything was excellent. The restaurant itself has great music, perfect lighting, and an overall gorgeous and relaxing ambiance. The attentive service was the cherry on top. Can’t wait to come back to try their Sunday brunch. Standouts were a perfectly seasoned and cooked steak, vegan pistachio cheesecake (highly recommend even if you’re not vegan!), and the most flavorful branzino dish I’ve ever had."
