    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Sava Shqutaj",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXGuSw9FsG4myu9Xl2-s_Q77uuMQpgJZ5mBo4QihE-DUe_C_wWjLg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "One of the most beautiful dining experiences in Miami has to be Ocean Grill at The Setai. Whether you’re going for a business lunch, a romantic dinner, or just an excuse to enjoy the scenery, this place absolutely delivers every single time. The atmosphere is elegant without feeling overly formal, the oceanfront setting is stunning, and the entire experience feels calm, elevated, and effortlessly luxurious.\n\nThe menu is incredibly well curated with fresh Mediterranean inspired dishes, amazing cocktails, and everything presented beautifully. It’s the kind of place where you actually want to slow down and enjoy the experience. Between the ocean breeze, gorgeous outdoor setting, and soft music playing in the background, the ambiance is honestly unmatched.\n\nWhat makes it so special is how versatile it is. Perfect for a client meeting during the day, but equally as perfect for a romantic dinner at night. One of those rare spots that feels both sophisticated and relaxing at the same time. Definitely one of my favorite places in Miami Beach. 🌴✨🍸"
      },
      {
        "author": "Veronica M",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUCcPEAp2AtERbdWTvqCLNpf3fIL8U6rgWAxJwg8zkDXKMiEYxd0w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Ocean Grill at The Setai was a fantastic dining experience. We had a reservation and were informed that non-hotel guests have about an hour and thirty minute dining window, which ended up being more than enough time to enjoy the meal without feeling rushed.\nWe started with the Wagyu carpaccio and it was amazing. For our main dishes we ordered the filet mignon and the Wagyu skirt steak with chimmichurri, along with sides of Brussels sprouts and steak fries. Everything was cooked perfectly and full of flavor. We finished the meal with the vanilla bean crème brûlée, which was also excellent.\nThe service was flawless from start to finish—from drinks to food delivery, everything was timed perfectly and the staff was attentive throughout. Overall, a great dining experience."
      },
      {
        "author": "Julia Roush",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLInzjgBws4qDw7PP6hoFHyOJMNrak1WG3ioOTkUYlVMJznoA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a week ago",
        "text": "The staff at the Ocean Grill are extremely professional and kind. Our food was delicious, and we will definitely return if we are in the area. A huge thank you to the staff that retrieved my phone after falling through an opening in the window/wall. They went above and beyond to ensure we had a great evening."
      }
    ]
