      "Friday: 7:00 – 11:30 AM, 12:30 – 3:30 PM, 6:30 – 11:00 PM",
      "Saturday: 7:00 – 11:30 AM, 12:30 – 3:30 PM, 6:30 – 11:00 PM",
      "Sunday: 7:00 – 11:30 AM, 12:00 – 2:30 PM"
