        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "What an incredible experience! The food was excellent, the steak was cooked perfectly, and everything we ordered was delicious. The atmosphere is amazing — very upscale, elegant, and professional without feeling pretentious. My wife and I had a wonderful evening.\n\nA special thank you to Morocco, who was genuinely kind, attentive, and made us feel welcome throughout the night. He truly helped make our experience even more enjoyable.\n\nBefore coming, I was a little concerned that the prices might be more about the name and atmosphere than the food, but I was pleasantly surprised. Yes, it’s a bit expensive, but not nearly as bad as I expected, and the quality absolutely shows. The food is truly delicious.\n\nOne thing worth mentioning: on Friday and Saturday nights, the restaurant can get quite lively and noisy. However, on the other days, the atmosphere is much more relaxed and enjoyable. During our visit, the music was not overly loud at all, and we were able to have a comfortable conversation throughout the evening.\n\nIf you enjoy a great steak and a memorable dining experience, this place is absolutely worth it. We will definitely be back!"
