        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Absolutely amazing experience! We were truly impressed by everything. The sushi was exceptional fresh, beautifully presented, and full of flavor. The steak was cooked perfectly, and the desserts were absolutely delicious.\n\nWhat made the evening even more special was the outstanding service from our waiter. He was attentive, professional, friendly, and made us feel genuinely welcome throughout the entire meal.\n\nOne of the best dining experiences we’ve had. Highly recommend, and we will definitely be coming back!\n\nThank you RJ!"
