        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "The pizza was amazing! Cooked in their 900 degree oven from Italy. Cooked for only 90 seconds, to literal perfection. The pasta was only ok.  The pasta flight lets you sample pastas from north to south Italy. The pasta at the Eataly in Chicago was a lot tastier, but this was a good experience overall! Everyone was really friendly"
