        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "I had an amazing Sunday brunch at Quinto. For $80 per person, the experience was absolutely worth it. It includes delicious food and drinks, with a great variety of high-quality options. The outdoor terrace is beautiful, spacious, and very comfortable, creating the perfect atmosphere to relax. The live music added a wonderful touch, and the service was attentive and friendly from beginning to end.\n\nIt was my birthday and my friend’s birthday, and the team made us feel so special by personalizing our menus with our names and a birthday message. It was such a thoughtful touch that made the celebration even more memorable. If you’re looking for an upscale brunch in Brickell, Quinto is definitely a place I would recommend. I can’t wait to come back!"
