        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "9 months ago",
        "text": "I always come to Sugar and the Tea Room, the main reason being Milos’s out of this world’s service(a million starts for him). The atmosphere is always great, the music will always elevate you at the right time: and it’s such a classic that it keeps you coming back. The best time you’ll ever have, that’s coming from a local; we really know what’s up and want you to have the best experience over here!!"
