        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "05/31/2026\nBalan’s Brickell\n\nThe Service & The Place:\nRight in the heart of Brickell in South Miami Avenue, Balan’s is a great place to feel that you belong, with its trendy crowd of young and adults people. Our sever, Maria was amazing. She was present. Friendly, attentive and accommodating.\n\nThe Food:\nWe ordered the “Balan’s Burger,” to share, since we were not that hungry. It was okay. We also ordered the “Spicy Rigatoni.” Too much sauce.\n\nBalan’s is great to spend time seeing and be seeing in the trendy Brickell neighborhood.\n\n“Eat deliciously\""
