      {
        "author": "C• r",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVl1WwUohMr0ML9a6DEIPq7fGQdSf1ThEGuHNploasbujcrrDc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "With all the rave of this place, I wanted to fall in love with it so bad. And the food was fine but the service was extremely disappointing. I was left embarrassed recommending a place that made my friends and I leave so uncomfortable.\n\nI came with some friends from out of town and wanted a place that would impress them but still casual enough for them in Brickell. They are unfamiliar with the \"social rules\" of Miami but Motek seemed to highlight all the negative ones here. The server took one look at us and deemed we were not worthy of his attention, presence, or service. The server was named Sebastien and he was extremely pushy and rude. He was constantly watching us but never came over to speak with us unless we called over another server or busser to get him. He tried to rush us into leaving when the restaurant was empty and his whole demeanor to us was so unwelcoming.\n\nThe decor was gorgeous but the food was not good enough to forgive the horrible service. If you want to go to a place, within a mall, that bases service around what you look like with hyper vigilant staff that watch your every move making it their mission to make you so uncomfortable you are forced to leave, then this is for you."
      },
      {
        "author": "Mo’",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI1FhClA7aO6n8gnKXbWSYh3zm6cNERG20DiEGELXhOOHmAT7M=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Milica was our server and she was an absolute gem! The atmosphere was relaxing. We sat outside and people watched while listening to some relaxing music. We got the babghanoush, crispy califlower, salmon ceviche and Greek lemon potatoes. Everything was served as it was made, fast service, and delicious food! I would highly recommend coming during their happy hour M - F from 3 - 7. Everything is $5 and the variety is there! Come check it out on a lunch break or just a quick catch up with friends."
      },
      {
        "author": "Emir Mambetov",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUTDR5-FPt4yIf_SctQaFbp02Gnr_B-Q3DpDQiJ9fPTv0z5kxeu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Beautiful place in the heart of Brickell. The interior is stunning — very stylish, bright, and full of greenery, which creates a really relaxing atmosphere 🌿\nFood was excellent — fresh, flavorful, and well presented. Everything we tried was on point.\nService was also great — friendly, attentive, and professional throughout the visit.\nDefinitely one of the best spots in Brickell for both casual dining and a nice evening out. Highly recommend 👌"
      }
