        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Met some friends for dinner here on a Sunday night. It was very quiet, only folks in the restaurant. My friend brought her toddler. They do not have high chairs but didn't have an issue with him being there.  The sushi is delicious, but please note they don't have a lot of flexibility in what they serve. They want you to stick to the menu. The fish was fresh and any sauces provided were tasty. Oh, the veggie roll is more substantial than other places with squash and mushrooms in the roll.\n\nWine and beer are served. No cocktails."
