        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Susiclub is hands down the best sushi spot I’ve had so far and I say that as a Miami native who’s tried a lot of places. The quality of the fish, the creativity of the rolls, and the overall vibe are on another level. Everything tasted incredibly fresh and thoughtfully prepared.\n\nOn top of that, Giancarlos delivered some of the best customer service I’ve experienced anywhere super attentive, welcoming, and genuinely made the night special. You can tell he really cares about the experience.\n\nIf you’re in Miami and love sushi, Susiclub is a must. I’ll definitely be back.❤️!!!!!"
