        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I honestly have no words to describe this place. This is by far my favorite sushi restaurant in Miami!!!!!!!!\n\nEverything was exceptional, from the service to the quality of every dish. The owner personally came to check in, which made the experience feel even more special.\n\nThe kampachi sashimi was hands down my number one favorite, absolutely out of this world. We also loved the tempura shrimp, and the fresh wasabi prepared at the table really shows the level of care and quality.\n\nWe finished with a matcha cake, and honestly, I couldn’t pick a favorite because everything was incredible. The price was also more than fair for the quality.\n\nAlready excited to come back. If you’re in Miami and love sushi, this place is a must. 100% recommend🤤🤤😍😍❤️❤️🙌🏻🙌🏻"
