      "Wednesday: 11:30 AM – 10:00 PM",
      "Thursday: 11:30 AM – 10:00 PM",
      "Friday: 11:30 AM – 11:00 PM",
      "Saturday: 11:30 AM – 11:00 PM",
      "Sunday: 11:30 AM – 10:00 PM"
