        "text": "I highly recommend this place. The food is very delicious, the prices are affordable, and the service is excellent. There were three of us we came to celebrate birthday, and we ordered a steak set for $98. We also chose four side dishes, and they came at the end with really delicious pancakes with ice cream, and everything was absolutely amazing. We were very satisfied and truly enjoyed our experience. I definitely recommend this place."
