        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Excellent service from Mateo and Victor. The Negroni that Mateo made for me was phenomenal. Smooth but hard hitting. If he’s at the bar just know you’re in for a good time. I ordered the skirt steak rare and it was cooked to perfection. The pomodoro is a must have, very saucy and the burrata cheese hits perfectly. I loved the attention and service from victor. Looking forward to my next visit!"
