        "text": "Genuinely the most fantastic Mediterranean food we’ve had in miami. Absolutely gorgeous preparation and incredible flavors. The halloumi, chicken and dips were out of this work. Really unlike most other restaurants in miami these days who prioritize on the atmosphere but that completely lack in the kitchen department. This place has both- and they really g above and beyond.\nService was also incredible and we were always attended too, we LOVED our server Yuni who was so accommodating with food allergies and communicating with the kitchen!!\n\n10/10 most visit!!"
