        "text": "Ate twice back to back weekends, was referred here for good steak, loved my filet minon the 1st time, had a spring salad with pear whiz was amazing too.  There are so many things I want to try. 2nd time had Chilean sea bass it was so good and flaky and the red\nPepper, those veggies were\nA\nBit chunky so didn’t taste. Oh and that bread pudding the crunch it was\nServed with was sooo delicious!!🤤"
