        "text": "Went there with wife, daughter, and boyfriend late Sunday. Restaurant is attractive  - not as nice as Boca location. We were seated in a large and private booth immediately. Our server Silvia was attentive from start to finish. The bread, hummus, falafel, fried cauliflower and tuna carpacio were great appetizers. My wife had the hanger steak and loved it. Boyfriend had a giant Ceaser Salad with watermelon that was delicious. I had this Turkisk ground beef & lamb on bread dish that was delicious. Daughter loved her giant salad. Very healthy high quality food, although a bit $$$. I was very happy with the service and would go back if in the area."
