        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I recently had dinner here and everything was FABULOUSLY DELICIOUS!!  A must order for appetizers is the Wedge--which is 3 pieces of bacon--it was sweet and savory!!  My main course was the Filet Mignon and it had the perfect crust on it, the middle was juicy and melted in my mouth!!  I also had the Stuffed Mushrooms as my side and it was truely delicious!  My only complaints were on the Kid's Menu--the pasta had absolutely no sauce and no flavor.  Also on the Kid's Menu, the chopped steak was hard like a rock.  So kids, order from the main menu and you can't go wrong!"
