      "Tuesday: 12:00 PM – 12:00 AM",
      "Wednesday: 12:00 PM – 12:00 AM",
      "Thursday: 12:00 PM – 12:00 AM",
      "Friday: 12:00 PM – 12:00 AM",
      "Saturday: 10:00 AM – 12:00 AM",
      "Sunday: 10:00 AM – 12:00 AM"
