        "text": "An interesting proposition that combines Mediterranean and Latin American cuisines offering innovative tastes on traditional dishes. We  tried the Lamb Baklava, and the Lamb Chops which were exquisite. Don’t miss the Pistacchio Cheesecake. The service was friendly and professional. Highly recommended!"
