      {
        "author": "anthony sarnataro",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX0gtwhUCd__CwOJMQglNHq3dhK6p6eYj0e8B2IxUiByDoc5To=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago",
        "text": "SoulEdge: Who Dares to love forever. ❤️\nArrived for dinner met Jake at the entrance. Then I met Frank my server, both gave good service. Ordered the Smoke BBQ Baby Back Ribs and Choco Coladita for dessert. The presentation of both dishes were spot on. The taste of the Ribs good. But the upper portion had a excess of fat. I removed it & the ribs just needed four more minutes. Dessert was impressive, and nice cruchy pistachio taste in the middle. For presentation purposes try placing the dessert upright. All in all service was excellent. Frank told me breakfast is served from 6:30 am & the buffet option too. This is good to know, for early folks who hit the ground running. Service was better than last time, I was there years ago. Visit dedicated to my then German American ex girlfriend who looks like Lagertha from a vikings tv show. Cue in \"Hold My Hand\"  song by Lady Gaga and \"Lose My Mind\" song by Don Toliver (ft. Doja Cat ) 🇺🇸🇩🇪🎸🙏\nUpdate Nov. 26, 2025. I rushed in early for breakfast. Met the hostess & Nordi my server. She gave me excellent service. I ordered a Eggs Benedict & grapefruit juice. The dish, the eggs were cooked perfectly, nice ham, its muffins just needed to be a bit more crispy. Good addition to include side  potatoes. Some establishments only included the Eggs Benedict, talk about short changing the customer."
      },
      {
        "author": "Dr Alo",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWumXQcZ9evre7K9w9CWEUr6E1c4LNOUPKrm7IG4xL_yj9l19X4-g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Loved the food and drinks. Even the virgin drinks are great! The tuna poke tacos were great and so was the citrus salad with salmon. Whatever this smokey drink was amazing too!"
      },
      {
        "author": "Distribuidoras Aglosa",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLDTFnejLT33zFQLbzo0bZ-JwMSdQFbJLB7MKK7PgsskF-nlA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Dinner at Gold Coast was a highlight of our visit. Olbert provided excellent service and was very knowledgeable about the menu, making great recommendations throughout our meal.\n\nCarlos, the manager, was friendly and engaged throughout our visit, regularly checking in and ensuring both guests and staff were well taken care of.\n\nThe outstanding service made our stay even more enjoyable, and we look forward to coming back!"
      }
