        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 weeks ago",
        "text": "I’ve been going to Mastro’s for about a year or two since I moved here.  By far the best steak I’ve had in Miami.  Makes Hells Kitchen look like a Waffle House.  The steak is excellent and come in on a hot plate which is how it always should be.  I usually sit at the bar where I’ve made friends with the bartenders and they are always super nice.  Danielle is truly the best behind the bar and makes me feel like I’m at my hometown bar.  The manager Nick is also a great dude and has accommodated for me and the people I’ve brought for dinner.  This is truly my favorite place to go in Miami."
