        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Had such an amazing birthday dinner at Mastro’s Ocean Club! From the moment we walked in, everything felt special. The scenery was beautiful, the live music created the perfect vibe, and the food was absolutely incredible my mom loved her steak!\nOur waitress Joanna was outstanding so attentive, kind, and made the whole experience feel effortless and enjoyable. The service was top-tier from start to finish. The Chefs Kiss!\nMastro’s truly offers more than just dinner—it’s a full experience. Definitely one of the best nights we’ve had. Can’t wait to come back!"
