        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "With how packed Miami downtown’s breakfast/brunch scene appears on Google Maps, I chose the boul’mich location of la Boulangerie for its selection of coffee drinks. Havent had a drink rimmed with syrup in a while.\n\nI was not disappointed.\n\nYUNIOR was my server and was quick to input my beverage request, delivery, food order, clarified if I wanted any adjustments, and food served in a timely manner.\n\nThe french toast with surprisingly sweet and tart fresh fruit was delicious.\n\nThank you YUNIOR for the prompt and friendly service."
