        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Had such an incredible experience from the moment we sat down, the service was top-tier. Our waitress, Taty, was amazing, and Ricardo was equally excellent, both made sure we were taken care of all night and delivered some of the best service we’ve had. The energy and vibe were unreal. The music was on point, and the programming never stopped, there was always something happening. From tambourines at the table to belly dancers on the bars, drummers, hookah service, and nonstop surprises throughout the night, it felt like a full experience, not just dinner. The food was delicious. The branzino and lemon potatoes were absolute standouts and cooked perfectly. And the crowd? Beautiful people everywhere… very Miami. If you want amazing food, high-energy entertainment, and an unforgettable night out, this is the spot. And this was was a Thursday night."
