        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Food delicious as always! We used to go a to the Coral Gables locations all the time and missed the flavor so much that ended up driving up to the Kendall location. The Ceviche fresh as always! The pulled pork tostones and chicken anticuchos as flavorful as always! Rafael was our server and he was very attentive and made our pleasant experience even better. Worth the drive!"
