        "rating": 2,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "My husband and I brought my mom here for her birthday and we were totally disappointed. The service was horrible. We had a server pass by us about 4 times without even acknowledging us but then went ahead and took the table in front of us that was seated about 20 mins AFTER us. The drinks were mediocre. The food was decent. Seems like people here get priority if you're a regular because every server had preference with other tables than us. Only good thing are all the photo ops places outside where you can take pictures. My husband did enjoy his shrimp ceviche. But besides that I don't have much to say. We were actually really excited to come here based on how cute the pictures looked online but would not come here again or recommend it. And nothing there is cheap. From the drinks, to appetizers to entrees. And the portions are relatively small. Really disappointed with this place. Took our server over 30 mins to bring us the check and to sing happy birthday to my mom which at that point we just told him to forget it but yet he insisted on doing so after he realized how long he took."
