        "text": "Had a wonderful breakfast experience at this boulangerie. The food was fresh, delicious, and beautifully prepared. The atmosphere was warm and inviting, making it the perfect place to start the day.\n\nA special thank you to Genesis, who provided exceptional service. She was friendly, attentive, and made us feel genuinely welcome from the moment we arrived. Her positive attitude and attention to detail truly enhanced our experience.\n\nWe’ll definitely be back and highly recommend this place to anyone looking for a great breakfast and outstanding service! ☕🥐😊"
