        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "I had an amazing time and our server Merlon Calderin  truly made the experience unforgettable. He was friendly, attentive, and professional from the moment we sat down. There is nothing that I enjoy more than a good quality service, someone that makes you feel welcomed and he did just that. He checked on us regularly without being intrusive, made great recommendations, and made sure everything came out exactly as we ordered. His positive attitude and genuine care for his customers really stood out. It’s clear he takes pride in providing excellent service. If you have the chance, definitely ask to be seated in his section. you won’t be disappointed!!\n\nThank you Merlon, for making our dining experience so enjoyable!"
