        "text": "I first went to Calle Dragones when they first opened years ago and the food, service, entertainment, and ambiance were all amazing. However, the prices were a little high.  I recently went back and the prices are now much more reasonable and if you can believe it, the food is even better!  I highly recommend that you give this place a try, especially during Happy Hour (check out Wednesdays where the Happy Hour extends until closing at the bar)! Also, check out the Miami Spice menu!"
