        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "If you’re looking to try new AMAZING FOOD, incredible atmosphere, an adventure of experiencing a piece of someone else’s culture and let’s not forget the amazing service, this is your place!!! Muni, our waitress, she played a HUGE part of making our dining experience so incredible!! First, her smile was so inviting, her confidence & knowledge of their menu was KEY!! I absolutely LOVE IT when I walk into a new restaurant, especially one such as this & the waitress is as big a help as Muni was!!\nIf I can suggest one tip… if they tell you an item serves TWO, they are NOT exaggerating!! LOL!! The food is so good, when you don’t heed their suggestion about getting a “smaller” dish, you will be absolutely miserable because you will not be able to throw in the towel!! LOL!!\nI HIGHLY RECOMMEND giving this place a shot!!"
