        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "WOW!!!\n\nThis place is an absolute gem.\n\nWe shared several dishes and every single one was better than the last. The cigars, arayes, challah schnitzel sandwich, shawarma on laffa, and the knafeh were all phenomenal.\n\nAs Israelis, we know Mediterranean food, and this was simply outstanding. Everything tasted fresh, authentic, and made with care.\n\nThe entire experience was amazing from start to finish.\n\nI also want to give a special shout-out to Ryan, our server. Ryan was absolutely incredible. You can genuinely tell that he loves what he does and takes pride in where he works. Every recommendation he gave us was a perfect choice. He checked on us throughout the meal, always made sure our drinks were full, kept us smiling and laughing, and treated us with exceptional kindness and professionalism.\n\nRyan was a huge part of what made this experience so memorable. Employees like him are hard to find, and he deserves recognition for the outstanding job he does. He represents your restaurant in the best possible way.\n\nThank you for such a memorable evening. We will definitely be back and will be recommending Motek to everyone we know.\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"
