        "text": "Honestly, one of the best restaurant experiences I’ve had in Miami. The service at Prima Pasta is absolutely excellent, easily top 3 out of all the restaurants I’ve been to in Miami. The prices are very reasonable, the service is impeccable, and the food is simply fabulous.\n\nThey have outdoor seating right in front of the street, a beautiful indoor dining area, and also a bar section. The atmosphere is warm, cozy, and truly transports you to a special place. We went as a family and had such a lovely time. We will definitely be coming back more than once.\n\nThank you for everything, Prima Pasta!"
