        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "9 months ago",
        "text": "🎉🍽️🥂 Maybe this place really shines for private events, because that’s what I attended tonight — and the staff were definitely on their game. Both the hors d’oeuvres and buffet were on point, with everything running smoothly. Desserts could’ve been a bit more filling, and the bathrooms a little closer, but overall, a great job and a well-run evening!"
