      {
        "author": "David Revilla",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIiyysQwxSeRh465f8bwIJa-Rmc-KMQg5DbfQzJEryqmq3-Uw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "It’s our 5th time at this restaurant, and honestly… 5 stars feels too low.\n\nTonight I came with my parents, and once again the experience was simply outstanding. We didn’t have a reservation, yet the host welcomed us warmly and seated us quickly without any hassle. From the very beginning, the attention to detail made us feel truly valued.\n\nThe service was exceptional across the board, the host, our waiter, and even the manager went above and beyond to make sure everything was perfect. You can genuinely feel the passion and professionalism in the way they treat their guests.\n\nWe started with the meatballs and bruschetta, both absolutely delicious and full of flavor. For my main course, I ordered the pasta di mare (the special one), and it was on another level, fresh seafood, perfectly cooked pasta, and that lobster just took it to a whole different experience.\n\nEverything about this place is consistent: the service, the atmosphere, and especially the food. It’s not easy to maintain this level every single time, but they do it effortlessly.\n\nHighly recommended. This is not just a restaurant, it’s an experience you’ll want to repeat again and again."
      },
      {
        "author": "Antoanella",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXNJbPOuKe3Crk8iueCqg2ruOMD78RLNQZ1bH5ny_jiH2YXkBft=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I can't say enough good things about this place! Everything from the food to the seating was outstanding. The restaurant is spotlessly clean and has a great atmosphere. What really made our visit special was the service. Nery and Magali were highly professional, attentive, and made sure we had everything we needed to enjoy our meal. Five stars!\""
      },
      {
        "author": "Cesar Collazo",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUqnKEgr8biPDqmhhlBcQw6rzwWdMZykd4tDg3o7RPYYQ4qLzoo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Came to this place once again and it was AMaZINg as usual! I didn’t know what to get today but the waitress Magali is phenomenal. She gave amazing recommendations to the twist of meal I had in mind and I THANK her for her help and recommendation! She nailed it ! Besides her service,great vibe ,and energy she brings to the table! That alone is worth coming here over and over.  The place is amazing all around. Music is great as well and the high end feeling and treatment makes this one of the best spots on this strip. We will continue to come here on our every visit from NYC"
      }
