        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I’m so happy we decided to come back! I was first introduced to Abbale by a friend during a brunch visit, and it was so impressive that I knew I had to return with my entire family for the holidays.\n\nEvery dish we tried was excellent. The shakshuka and tuna tartare really stood out as favorites, though the chicken and burgers were just as tasty. We sat outdoors, and the atmosphere was ideal—surrounded by greenery, it felt relaxed, cozy, and pleasantly private.\n\nWhat truly elevated our visit was our server, Martinica. She was outstanding—warm, attentive, and genuinely welcoming. Her service made us feel well cared for from start to finish. It’s not often you find a place in South Beach that delivers such high quality while still feeling so inviting. We’ll absolutely be returning!"
