        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "What a gem! Everything was delicious and fresh. The tahini soft serve is amazing. Martinique is hospitality personified. She is knowledgeable about the menu, has a wonderful and welcoming demeanor and is truly exceptional. She takes the time to make sure your experience is top notch and not rushed which is so rare to find these days, especially in Miami and especially in South beach. We will definitely be back!"
