        "text": "Such a beautiful gem of a spot. Foodies visiting south beach, don’t miss the spot, assuming it’s a tourist trap of a restaurant. ITS DEFINITELY NOT!\n\nThis is a beautiful spot with great service, portion size, GREAT DEALS (BOGO MARTINIS) and beautiful views of the beach.\n\nAldair the server has amazing service. Everything was fun, he was tentative, and the manager was also engaging.\n\nDefinitely a safe spot to go to for good food, great happy hour, and good music/vibes."
