        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "This place was so fun! Our first time in Miami and we found the most perfect Italian spot. My husband is GF but he tried everything - because it was that good and all made in the restaurant. Truly a wonderful experience. We ordered a chicken Cesar salad, arugula and prosciutto pizza, and the burrata with focaccia. It was all so amazing. We also loved our server, Marina. She shared some Miami recommendations with us."
