        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "My husband and I had dinner at Baires Grill, and it was exactly the kind of experience we were looking for. We chose patio seating, and it was perfect. The atmosphere was intimate, relaxing, and there was a beautiful breeze throughout the evening.\n\nTo start, I ordered a Lemon Drop Martini while my husband enjoyed an Old Fashioned. For our entrées, we both had the New York Strip. I paired mine with mashed potatoes, and my husband chose the jasmine rice. Everything was cooked well and full of flavor.\n\nWhat truly made the experience special was the service. Our server was incredibly polite, attentive, and welcoming. We never felt rushed, and our food and drinks arrived quickly.\n\nIf you’re looking for a nice date night spot in Miami Beach with great food, excellent service, and a romantic atmosphere, Baires Grill is definitely worth a visit. We thoroughly enjoyed our evening and would happily return.\n\n💕🥩🍸✨\n\n— Amber & Husband\n#DateNightApproved #MiamiBeachDining #BairesGrill #CouplesNightOut"
