        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "We loved our dining experience with the Drexel. We celebrated our anniversary there and had the recommended ribeye and sides and it was amazing!  We also had a few cocktail hours here and each time the staff were warm and welcoming. Martina was an amazing server and we enjoyed having her take care of us while we dined."
