        "text": "We came here to celebrate my daughter’s birthday, and we had an amazing experience! Our server was attentive, friendly, and did a wonderful job accommodating our party’s dietary restrictions.\n\nWe ordered a variety of dishes, and my favorites were the La Terraza Wrap and the Mezze Selection. The steak was cooked to perfection, and everything we tried was fresh and flavorful.\n\nThe ambiance made the experience even better—they had the World Cup game playing, which created a fun and lively atmosphere. Whether you’re looking for a place to enjoy a family celebration or a girls’ night out, I highly recommend this spot.\n\n10/10 experience—we’ll definitely be back!"
