        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "For my birthday, my friend Maria José invited me to dine at Mother Wolf in the Miami Design District, and the experience was outstanding from start to finish. The food was absolutely amazing, with every dish exceeding expectations.\n\nWe started with the gnocchi appetizer, which was perfectly prepared and full of flavor. The pasta course was equally spectacular—fresh, authentic, and beautifully executed. To finish, we enjoyed the tiramisu, which was simply exceptional: rich, light, and the perfect ending to a memorable meal.\n\nThe atmosphere, service, and attention to detail made the entire experience even more enjoyable. Mother Wolf delivers an authentic Italian dining experience, and I can't wait to return. Highly recommended!"
