        "text": "The whole experience was amazing from start to finish. We started with the burrata salad and the wagyu meatballs, both incredibly flavorful and perfectly prepared. For the main dishes, the pasta and the skirt steak were outstanding, every bite was delicious.\n\nTo finish, we had the tiramisu, which was absolutely perfect, and they even surprised us with complimentary pistachio ice cream that was so good. The service was exceptional and the ambiance made the night even more special. Definitely one of my favorite spots for a great dinner!"
