        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Fantastic Peruvian restaurant! We ordered the yuca à la guancaina, lomo saltado, sushi, and pulpo, and every dish was outstanding. The flavors were fresh, authentic, and beautifully presented. The lomo saltado was perfectly seasoned, the pulpo was tender and flavorful, and the yuca were delicious. Even the sushi was creative and fresh. Excellent service and a great atmosphere we’ll definitely be back!\nAna"
