        "text": "Had an amazing experience at Uma Cantina Peruana! The food was fresh, flavorful, and full of authentic Peruvian taste. The atmosphere was beautiful and welcoming, making it a great place to enjoy with family or friends.\n\nA special thank you to Carolina for the outstanding service. She was attentive, friendly, and made sure everything was perfect during our visit. Her positive attitude truly made the experience even better. Definitely coming back again and highly recommend this restaurant!"
