        "text": "Yer was the best service I ever had in Bulla Gastrobar Bar the Falls Mall. She went above and beyond making sure everything was perfect. She recommended different Taps were we could share and explain to us the wine selection they had. At the end she made our day with bringing my dad a surprise birthday churros to sing him happy birthday.  What an experience I will never forget.  Well recommended.  When you come to Bulla Gastrobar Bar in the Falls  ask for Yer she is the best in Miami."
