        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "This was our first time dining at this Spanish restaurant, and it turned out to be an exceptional experience. The Paella Mixto was cooked to perfection, and the grilled octopus with corn sauce was a delightful addition. The Chicken in blue cheese was a fantastic combination with fries, and the red sangria was refreshing.\n\nOur server, Dario, was attentive and knowledgeable, providing us with helpful suggestions for menu items. Unfortunately, they didn’t have the passion fruit cheesecake that my husband had been searching for, but they were generous enough to offer us a complimentary churros, which we thoroughly enjoyed."
