        "text": "I had such an amazing experience at 107 Taste! The food was absolutely delicious — fresh, flavorful, and beautifully presented. Everything came out quickly and tasted incredible.\n\nA huge shoutout to my servers, Cristina and Api! They were so attentive, friendly, and made us feel genuinely welcomed from start to finish. They checked on us consistently, made great recommendations, and had the sweetest energy the whole time. Customer service like that really makes all the difference.\n\nI’ll definitely be coming back and recommending this spot to everyone I know. Thank you for such a wonderful experience!"
