        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Always love going to Old Lisbon and just tried this location for the first time. Food was great but rannn here to review our server Rodrigo! He went above and beyond to make us feel comfortable with our two children. Our one year old was having a hard time and he kindly offered a coloring page. When his cup of water spilled, Rodrigo came right over to clean it up and didn’t make us feel like a burden. Going out with kids can be tough, but servers like Rodrigo make it feel a little more doable! Thank you and we will be back! :)"
