        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 weeks ago",
        "text": "I had dinner at Sparrow Italia Miami while visiting Miami, and as a big fan of the London location, I was excited to experience the Miami restaurant as well.\n\nI regularly dine at Sparrow Italia in London and have always loved the food, so I was pleased to find that the Miami location delivered the same high standard. The food was excellent, with generous portions that were noticeably larger compared to the London restaurant, while still maintaining the quality and flavours I love.\n\nWhat I particularly enjoyed about the Miami location was the size of the restaurant and the overall atmosphere. It has a beautiful ambience, and the live music added a wonderful energy to the evening without taking away from the dining experience.\n\nThe prices were also reasonable considering the quality of the food and the overall experience. I was very happy to have visited Sparrow Italia Miami and would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for great food, a lively atmosphere, and a memorable dining experience."
