        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Bakan was an amazing experience. The food was absolutely delicious, every dish was full of flavor and beautifully prepared. The restaurant itself is stunning, with a beautiful atmosphere that makes the whole dining experience feel special. On top of that, the service was excellent, the staff was attentive, friendly, and made us feel very welcome. Definitely a place I’d highly recommend for great Mexican food, beautiful ambiance, and outstanding service."
