        "text": "Tried this spot for the first time tonight—easily some of the best sushi hand rolls I’ve had in Miami. Everything was incredibly fresh and well-balanced.\n\nThe hamachi jalapeño appetizer was a standout—clean, succulent yellowtail with just the right kick. The four hand roll combo was amazing, especially the hamachi chimichurri and toro taco.\n\nGreat vibe, and the staff was super welcoming and attentive. 10/10 experience—can’t wait to order again."
