        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "As me and my husband were driving around Whynwood on our last day in Miami before heading back to airport we saw this restaurant and it drew our attention. I am so greatful we decided to walk in..we were immediately greeted with kindness, excitement that we arrived. Our server Saray was so pleasant and attentive. The manager was walking around making sure everyone was happy with service.  Now let's talk about the food.  Every bite is an explosion .  Fresh, tasty , presentation was a piece of art. Thank you as it is very hard to find this kind of service now and days .\nJan"
